The upstream is the ISO C standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018), whose library summary
names the macros this package maps; no text of the standard is included. The
implementation is the target's C library, under its own license, and the
function-like macros of include/mwrap/libc/macros.hpp are that library's own
definitions, reached through its headers.
